<!--
  BSU Dining (bridgew.sodexomyway.com) - manually maintained sitemap
  Built 2026-09-10. Every URL below was loaded and confirmed to return
  readable text without JavaScript, which the site's own homepage does not.

  17 URLs: 8 dining location pages, 9 other student-facing pages.

  DELIBERATELY EXCLUDED

  /en-us/locations/hours
      The aggregate hours page. Its markup does not bind each location's
      name to its own hours, so ingesting it pairs every location with the
      previous location's times. This is the page that told a student Dunkin'
      opens at 5:00 p.m., which are The Bear Trap's hours.

  /en-us/                       Homepage. Returns no body text without JavaScript.
  /en-us/meal-plan/meal-plan-quiz   Interactive quiz, no static text.
  /en-us/sodexosustainability/mass-impact   Generic Sodexo corporate content, not BSU specific.
  /en-us/categories/dining-hall
  /en-us/categories/retail-dining
      Both returned "Failed to learn" in Element451 on 2026-09-10. Their
      location cards are rendered by JavaScript, so there is almost no static
      text to extract, and the locations they list are already covered by the
      eight location pages above. Do not re-add.

  /en-us/privacy-policy         Not student facing.
  /en-us/terms-and-conditions   Not student facing.

  NOTES

  The location pages carry regular hours, a Special Hours block with explicit
  date ranges, plus address and phone. Special Hours entries are NOT removed
  after they pass: as of this build, four locations still display the Labor Day
  09/05/2026 to 09/07/2026 entry, and Flynn also shows 08/31/2026 to 09/01/2026
  and an entry reading "Tuesday Campus BBQ Day" with no date range at all.

  Crimson Dining is published as both "Monday to Sunday 05:00 PM - 11:00 PM"
  and "Friday - Saturday Closed" on its own page. That contradiction is in
  BSU Dining's data, not in this sitemap.

  No <lastmod> values are included. The site exposes no modification dates.
-->
